			"notes": "### Nimble ReWynnded 0.7.0 Changelog\n\n- Updated to Minecraft 1.21.11\n- Updated dependencies for Fabric API (0.141.3+1.21.11) and Fabric Loader (0.18.4)\n- Ported to Official Mojang Mappings and Java 21\n- Replaced `EntityMixin` with a polled check in `onClientTick` for improved stability\n- Removed `EntityMixin.java` and `nimblerewynnded.mixins.json`\n- Added support for Wynncraft custom mounts (`class_1501` / Horses, Wyverns, Adasaurs)\n- Added support for Wynncraft furniture (`class_1621` / ArmorStands)\n- Expanded mount whitelist: `Horse`, `SkeletonHorse`, `ZombieHorse`, `Camel`, `Strider`, `Boat`, `Minecart`, and `ArmorStand`\n- Added Simplified Chinese (`zh_cn`) translation\n- Fixed all package mapping errors for 1.21.x animal entities\n- Removed debug logging"
		},
